@baseUrl = http://localhost:7076

### Start the three-step sequential orchestration
# @name startSequential
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orchestrations/hello

### Check the sequential orchestration status
GET {{startSequential.response.body.$.statusQueryGetUri}}

### Start the fan-out/fan-in orchestration
# @name startFanOut
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orchestrations/fan-out
Content-Type: application/json

5

### Check the fan-out/fan-in orchestration status
GET {{startFanOut.response.body.$.statusQueryGetUri}}
